                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unfortunately, a really poor game. I don't want to sh** on it too much because it has potential, but in my opinion is a sorely unfinished game that needs a lot of refining and some general professionalism.\n\nThe English is broken and incorrect, and all characters are voiced by the same two people. If English is not these people's strong suit, even so much as recording in their first language and using subtitles would be a better experience. With some better voice acting and proper scripting, it could be a half way decent way to kill half an hour considering the only real story is talking to other characters. \n\nIf you're collecting achievements or perfect games, it's very easy to get all 5 steam achievements in just about half an hour. Most of this is idle time. Otherwise, there is no reason to purchase this game.",
